@base = http://localhost:38088/api/v1

### Login ADMIN for 01, 03 and 04. Choose the "current" environment after preparing data.
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"DevPassword123!"}

> {% client.global.set('currentAdmin', response.body.accessToken); %}

### 01 - First delivery: two units of P and three of Q
POST {{base}}/purchase-orders/{{purchaseId}}/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{currentAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{receiptRequestId}}","deliveryReference":"{{deliveryReference}}","lines":[{"productId":{{productP}},"quantity":2},{"productId":{{productQ}},"quantity":3}]}

### 01 - Same delivery, same UUID, reversed line order: must return the SAME receipt
POST {{base}}/purchase-orders/{{purchaseId}}/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{currentAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{receiptRequestId}}","deliveryReference":"{{deliveryReference}}","lines":[{"productId":{{productQ}},"quantity":3},{"productId":{{productP}},"quantity":2}]}

### 01 - Different quantity, same UUID: must remain 409
POST {{base}}/purchase-orders/{{purchaseId}}/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{currentAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{receiptRequestId}}","deliveryReference":"{{deliveryReference}}","lines":[{"productId":{{productP}},"quantity":4},{"productId":{{productQ}},"quantity":3}]}

### 02 - Log in as operations on device A
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"operations","password":"DevPassword123!"}

> {% client.global.set('deviceA', response.body.accessToken); %}

### 02 - A SECOND LOGIN of the SAME account on device B
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"operations","password":"DevPassword123!"}

> {% client.global.set('deviceB', response.body.accessToken); %}

### 02 - Both devices initially work: run this with deviceA and deviceB
GET {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceB}}

### 02 - Log out device A
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceA}}

### 02 - Device A must get 401
GET {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceA}}

### 02 - Device B must STILL get 200
GET {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceB}}

### 03 - Find the customer shown by prepare-current-batch.ps1 -Ticket 03
GET {{base}}/reports/sales?size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{currentAdmin}}

### 04 - Run with slow-shipping.mjs serving 39098: must return 503 before its 1500 ms response
POST {{base}}/orders/{{slowOrderId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{currentAdmin}}

### 04 - While completion fails the order must remain CONFIRMED
GET {{base}}/orders/{{slowOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{currentAdmin}}

### 05 - API reveals the second page that Angular must also load
GET {{base}}/products?page=1&size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{currentAdmin}}
